d":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-15T19:05:50Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T21:57:08Z","closed_at":"2025-08-18T13:56:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109647","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109647","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109647.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109647.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-18T13:56:39Z"},"body":"Fix a bug that prevents setting up the composition layer provider when the Android surface is set **after** updating the layer's visibility.\r\n\r\nThe following flow works as expected:\r\n```\r\ncomposition_layer.use_android_surface = true\r\ncomposition_layer.visible = true\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut swapping the order to the following breaks setting up the composition layer provider:\r\n```\r\ncomposition_layer.visible = true\r\ncomposition_layer.use_android_surface = true\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is because of the following:\r\n- When the visibility is updated, `_setup_composition_layer_provider()` is invoked in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0c51ede2434d99d2c80dc87b7df179db66537f1c/modules/openxr/scene/openxr_composition_layer.cpp#L622\r\n- That call is a no-op because `use_android_surface` and `layer_viewport` are `false` at that point\r\n- When `composition_layer.use_android_surface = true` is invoked, then [`set_use_android_surface`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0c51ede2434d99d2c80dc87b7df179db66537f1c/modules/openxr/scene/openxr_composition_layer.cpp#L324) is invoked\r\n- `set_layer_viewport(nullptr)` invoked as part of that flow in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0c51ede2434d99d2c80dc87b7df179db66537f1c/modules/openxr/scene/openxr_composition_layer.cpp#L331\r\n- That call is a no-op because `layer_viewport = nullptr`\r\n- `set_use_android_surface(...)` completes without the composition layer being set up.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109647/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109647/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}